From 07a0b44e1810543298148e9ebb20f391031bc552 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 11:26:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: Add boot phase tags for STMicroelectronics
 mp15 boards

The bootph-all flag was introduced in dt-schema
(dtschema/schemas/bootph.yaml) to define node usage across
different boot phases.

To ensure SD boot, timer, gpio, syscfg, clock and uart nodes need to be
present in all boot stages, so add missing bootph-all phase flag
to these nodes to support SD boot.

Change-Id: Ib4c47beee940fa6883114c486b987793ca05bcdb
Signed-off-by: Patrice Chotard <patrice.chotard@foss.st.com>
